OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal made over decades-long
OL,4,Aunsolved murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman murdered 26 years
OL,7,Fago have renewed their appeal to the
OL,8,Fpublic to help identify the culprit.
OL,10,FVicky Glass was last seen being dropped
OL,11,Foff by a taxi driver in Middlesbrough
OL,12,Fat about 04:00 BST on 24 September
OL,13,F2000, three days after her 21st
OL,14,Fbirthday.
OL,16,FHer body was found six weeks later in a
OL,17,Fstream in Danby, North Yorkshire. Four
OL,18,Farrests have been in the time since -
OL,19,Fthe most recent in June - but no
OL,20,Fcharges have been made.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
